[agent] The deliverable exists on the platform: feature group **`scores30c485`, version 1**, populated and verified.
[agent] **What I did, all platform-side:**
[agent] 1. **Ingested** `data/feature_history.csv` (547 revisions, 80 accounts) into a feature group `feature_history_raw` via `hops fg insert`.
[agent] 2. **Ran a Python job on the platform** (`hops job deploy --run --wait`) that read the raw FG from the offline store, did the point-in-time selection (most recent revision with `event_time ≤ T = 1773410400000` per account — later revisions excluded), applied the logistic model `sigmoid(1.1161·f1 + 0.6773·f2 + 0.155·f3 + 0.2799)` rounded to 6 decimals, and wrote the results to the target FG.
[agent] 3. **Created `scores30c485` v1** online-enabled, record key `account_id`, with exactly two columns: `account_id` (string) and `score` (double) — one row per account (80 rows).
